$ completion --help
usage: completion  --mesh value [--scheme value] [--help] [--markdown] [--version] [--man] [--show-completion [SHELL]] [--install-completion [SHELL]] {post} ...

A solver


Required switches:
   --mesh value, -m value
    Mesh file

Optional switches:
   --scheme value, value in: `weno5,muscl`
    default value weno5
    Space scheme
   --help, -h
    Print this help message
   --markdown, -md
    Save this help message in a Markdown file
   --version, -v
    Print version
   --man
    Save this help message as a man page
   --show-completion [SHELL], value in: `bash,zsh,fish,powershell`
    Print the completion script of SHELL (default: $SHELL)
   --install-completion [SHELL], value in: `bash,zsh,fish,powershell`
    Install the completion script of SHELL (default: $SHELL) in $HOME

Commands:
  post
          Post processing

For more detailed commands help try:
  completion post -h,--help
